(d) the details of monitoring framework, reporting timelines and future roadmap to scale up the scheme and address region specific justice delivery gaps?

(a) the number of such women who completed Pradhan Mantri Kaushal Vikas Yojana (PMKVY) supported training and remained engaged in AI-related employment, apprenticeships or advanced skilling programmes for at least six months and twelve months after completion, scheme-wise and sector-wise;
